- Near the bottom: a navigation bar with 4 destinations: "Home" (home), "Search" (search), "Saved" (favorite), "Settings" (settings); "Search" is selected.

## Behavior and navigation
- The "Open" button opens the "Home wide" screen with a slide in from the right when tapped.
